window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Teasing a wolf usually gets you bit. That’s why I never made a move on my best friend.</b><br> <br> But when he saves me from the worst fate of all, facing my family without the fiancé I told them I had, he becomes hard to resist.<br> <br> Was it a mistake to agree to marry a guy I had only known for two weeks? Maybe. But there was something magical about him. And as the only one in my friend group who wasn’t a shifter or fae, the chemistry between us was the closest I was going to get to being one of them. <br> <br> Or was it? Because after my grandmother dies, I discover a family secret. Maybe there’s a reason I’m drawn to shifters past how smokin’ hot they are–especially my best friend, Titus.<br> <br> Could he help me reveal my family’s legacy? Or is it a curse? And when the dust settles and my wolf shifter bestie turns into more than just a friend, could my life end up crazier than it already was? I’m willing to have as many steamy nights with Titus as it takes to find out.<br> <br> <i>My Mate’s Curse is a scorching hot wolf shifter romance with crackling tension, humor, and enough spicy sizzle to leave you satisfied at its HEA ending.</i><br> <br> <i>Note: This book is a part of the author's 'Love is Love Collection', meaning that it is available as a spicy romance in 'My Best Friend', a wholesome romance in 'I Don’t Date My Best Friend', a steamy wolf shifter romance in ‘My Mate’s Curse’, and a Male/Male romance in 'Best Friend Trouble'.</i>\"<br> <br> This anthology includes:</p> <ul> <li><i>Son of a Beast</i></li> <li><i>Tortured Wolf</i></li> <li><i>My Mate's Curse</i></li> </ul>"; 
